-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Beneath <a href=\"#/wiki/Razachai\">Razachai</a> (enter <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33075,31188,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33075, 31188, 7)</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Zao%20Plantations\">Northern Zao Plantations</a> (all around <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33147,31108,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33147, 31108, 7)</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Brimstone%20Bug%20Caves\">Brimstone Bug Caves</a> (enter <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33220,31102,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33220, 31102, 7)</a> or <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33293,31141,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33293, 31141, 7)</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Chyllfroest\">Chyllfroest</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos%20Spider%20Lair\">Krailos Spider Lair</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tFights until death and paralyzes the target very often.<br/><br/>A brimstone bug attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tTry to not run between lots of them because they can deal high damage. Try to stand diagonal to avoid the beam and wave. They drop many <a href=\"#/wiki/Creature%20Products\">Creature Products</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" i